WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.340
Will you have enough income when you stop working?

2
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.980
In Cyprus, retirement income usually comes from three sources:

3
00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:10.547
Social Insurance, a provident fund if

4
00:00:10.547 --> 00:00:13.367
you have one, and your own savings.

5
00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:16.696
For many people, the Social Insurance pension

6
00:00:16.696 --> 00:00:19.145
covers only part of the income they had.

7
00:00:19.703 --> 00:00:22.651
That difference is the gap worth working out early.

8
00:00:23.751 --> 00:00:27.199
Especially if you are self-employed, if you earn more than

9
00:00:27.199 --> 00:00:32.133
the maximum insurable earnings, which in 2026 are sixty-eight thousand

10
00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:36.393
nine hundred and four euros a year, or if you had career breaks.

11
00:00:37.493 --> 00:00:39.048
Time matters most of all:

12
00:00:39.107 --> 00:00:42.473
every year you wait raises the monthly amount you need.

13
00:00:43.573 --> 00:00:48.135
Work out an estimate of your goal with the free tool on avrastro.com.
